sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Antigravity Memory OS - End-to-End Provenance Flow & Audit Lineage

    actor User as User / Developer
    participant Agent as Antigravity Agent
    participant Hook as Pre/Post Tool Hooks (scripts/hooks/*.py)
    participant Bus as CandidateBus (scripts/candidate_bus.py)
    participant Inbox as Inbox Staging (.agents/memory/inbox/candidates.jsonl)
    participant Compiler as MemoryCompiler Gatekeeper (scripts/memory_compiler.py)
    participant Canonical as Canonical Storage (.agents/memory/*.md)
    participant Substrate as MemSearch Substrate (Milvus Lite + ONNX bge-m3)
    participant CtxCompiler as ContextCompiler (scripts/context_compiler.py)

    Note over User, Agent: Turn Execution & Operational Event
    User->>Agent: Prompt / Instruction
    Agent->>Hook: Tool Invocation (run_command / write_to_file)
    Hook->>Hook: PreToolUse Security Gate (scan_text for zero secrets)
    Hook->>Agent: Allow Execution (or fail-closed deny)
    Agent->>Hook: PostToolUse Hook (exit code, stdout, stderr, cwd)

    Note over Hook, Bus: Experience Capture & Provenance Extraction
    Hook->>Bus: capture_tool_event(tool, args, output, exit_code, session_id, turn_id)
    Bus->>Bus: Filter routine noise (ls, echo, status checks)
    Bus->>Bus: Compute deterministic SHA-256 hashes (content_hash, output_hash)
    Bus->>Bus: Attach typed provenance (session_id, turn_id, commit, command, timestamp)
    Bus->>Bus: Scan candidate for secrets via SecretScanner
    Bus->>Inbox: Stage record to candidates.jsonl (idempotent append under file_lock)

    Note over Inbox, Compiler: 5-Gate Admission & Source Authority Verification
    Compiler->>Inbox: Read candidate records
    Compiler->>Compiler: Gate 1: Secret Hygiene Gate (scan_text)
    Compiler->>Compiler: Gate 2: Durability Threshold Gate (durability >= 3.0)
    Compiler->>Compiler: Gate 3: Schema Validation Gate (v2.0.0 compliance)
    Compiler->>Compiler: Gate 4: Source Authority Gate (verify_provenance: path/commit/command)
    Compiler->>Compiler: Gate 5: Redundancy / Duplication Gate (Jaccard & exact hash)

    Note over Compiler, Canonical: Canonical Promotion & Bitemporality
    alt All 5 Gates Pass (AdmissionDecision: ACCEPT)
        Compiler->>Canonical: Atomic write to DECISIONS.md / GOTCHAS.md / ARCHITECTURE.md
        Note over Canonical: Injects bitemporal comment: id, observed_at, valid_from, supersedes
        Compiler->>Substrate: Enqueue for semantic vector indexing (single-writer lease)
    else Gates Fail or Speculative (HOLD / REJECT)
        Compiler-->>Inbox: Quarantine in inbox or reject to rejected_secrets.jsonl
    end

    Note over Substrate, CtxCompiler: Retrieval & Trust Verdict Compilation
    User->>CtxCompiler: Query Context for Subsequent Session
    CtxCompiler->>Substrate: Hybrid search (RRF: Dense Vector + BM25 Lexical)
    Substrate-->>CtxCompiler: Retrieved chunks with provenance metadata
    CtxCompiler->>CtxCompiler: Evaluate Trust Verdict (CERTIFY, ADVISORY, WARN, BLOCK)
    CtxCompiler->>CtxCompiler: Exclude BLOCK chunks; format progressive disclosure (L1/L2/L3)
    CtxCompiler-->>Agent: Injected memory context with full provenance citations
